{"logId": "b1d2d586-33a2-4227-8599-a967bd8d446b", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [372, 121, 942, 165], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[372.0, 121.0], [942.0, 121.0], [942.0, 165.0], [372.0, 165.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四级【3~4分】：基于独立生命个体的觉知和觉醒，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，与父母平等相处的状态。（平等）", "block_bbox": [361, 232, 1591, 308], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[361.0, 232.0], [1591.0, 232.0], [1591.0, 308.0], [361.0, 308.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：父母与子女是相互独立的生命个体，超越传统的尊卑长幼和孝顺，彼此之间除了法定的教育和赡养责任外，各自有各自的生命和生活。父母与子女之间像朋友一样平等、坦率地相处，几乎没有避而不谈的话题。彼此也不承担相互之间的愿望继承。", "block_bbox": [363, 343, 1608, 464], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[363.0, 343.0], [1608.0, 343.0], [1608.0, 464.0], [363.0, 464.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [365, 492, 535, 524], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[365.0, 492.0], [535.0, 492.0], [535.0, 524.0], [365.0, 524.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、与父母是朋友的关系，可以平等、坦率、自然地交流，几乎没有避而不谈的话题", "block_bbox": [386, 543, 1359, 575], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[386.0, 543.0], [1359.0, 543.0], [1359.0, 575.0], [386.0, 575.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不因父母问题影响自己正常生活（如父母疾病、生活不能自理、父母感情等）", "block_bbox": [387, 587, 1319, 618], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[387.0, 587.0], [1319.0, 587.0], [1319.0, 618.0], [387.0, 618.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、不要求父母帮忙带孩子（不束缚父母、引导父母过自己独立的生活；避免两代人的教育观念不同产生矛盾和摩擦，主要由夫妻双方承担抚养和教育孩子的职责）", "block_bbox": [388, 630, 1605, 705], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 630.0], [1605.0, 630.0], [1605.0, 705.0], [388.0, 705.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、不与父母同住", "block_bbox": [389, 716, 599, 748], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 716.0], [599.0, 716.0], [599.0, 748.0], [389.0, 748.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [367, 777, 563, 808], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[367.0, 777.0], [563.0, 777.0], [563.0, 808.0], [367.0, 808.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、床前伺候，事事亲力亲为，精神包袱和痛苦极大", "block_bbox": [389, 826, 992, 857], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 826.0], [992.0, 826.0], [992.0, 857.0], [389.0, 857.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、过度操办父母葬礼，为后人增加负担", "block_bbox": [389, 869, 862, 900], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 869.0], [862.0, 869.0], [862.0, 900.0], [389.0, 900.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[59]", "block_bbox": [968, 971, 1018, 995], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[968.0, 971.0], [1017.0, 971.0], [1017.0, 994.0], [968.0, 994.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8631672263145447, "coordinate": [372, 121, 942, 165], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[372.0, 121.0], [942.0, 121.0], [942.0, 165.0], [372.0, 165.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7693460583686829, "coordinate": [361